&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;一時点で移転される財又はサービス&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 108px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 6px; text-align: right"&gt;8,657&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 108px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 6px; text-align: right"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 108px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 6px; text-align: right"&gt;21,242&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 108px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 6px; text-align: right"&gt;29,900&lt;/p&gt;
